  <Docs>
    <summary>Identifies the stopped, running, or error state of a TV interactive application.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>This .NET enum represents the <c>INTERACTIVE_APP_STATE_*</c> constants in <see cref="T:Android.Media.TV.Interactive.TvInteractiveAppManager" />. These values describe an application session, not the readiness of the service.</para>
      <para>See the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/media/tv/interactive/TvInteractiveAppManager#INTERACTIVE_APP_STATE_STOPPED">Android interactive app state reference</a></format>.</para>
    </remarks>
